Package: dialtone
Title: Parse, Validate and Format Phone Numbers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Gaurav", "Sood", , "gsood07@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
      person("Google Inc.", role = "cph", comment = "libphonenumber code and metadata"))
Description: Parses, validates, classifies and formats phone numbers for every
    country and non-geographic calling code, fast and vectorized over character
    vectors. Rules and example numbers come from the metadata of Google's
    'libphonenumber' <https://github.com/google/libphonenumber>, pinned to a
    release, with no 'Java' dependency, no runtime downloads and no
    free-text scanner. Malformed input returns FALSE or NA
    rather than an error.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://gojiplus.github.io/dialtone/,
    https://github.com/gojiplus/dialtone
